        "original_id": "40a05e95-3564-58f6-91a7-6660f3f1b7a5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Miklos Wright, Kevin Costner, Jeter, Bill Costner, Sharon Costner\n- Works: Open Range, Mr. Brooks, Southland, Chicago PD\n- Topics: film editing, final on-screen appearance, dedications\n\nFacts:\n- Miklos Wright is an American film editor.\n- Miklos Wright's notable editing works include the films Open Range and Mr. Brooks.\n- Open Range and Mr. Brooks both starred Kevin Costner.\n- Miklos Wright also worked on multiple episodes of the television series Southland and Chicago PD.\n- Jeter died before Open Range was released.\n- Open Range was Jeter's final on-screen appearance.\n- Open Range was dedicated to Jeter's memory and to the memory of Kevin Costner's parents, Bill Costner and Sharon Costner.",
